<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">RRK54.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 ABATESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha ya Kabiri ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Abatesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Abatesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA YA KABIRI EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABATESALONIKA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Paulo na Siluwaano na Timoseo twabahandiikira imwe ab'ekanisa y'Abatesalonika abari omuri Ruhanga Isheboona na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo; <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />nitubendeza embabazi n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Tataitwe na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucwa orubanja aha kiro ky'okwija kwa Mukama waitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 1:2">1 Tes 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="1TH 1:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kitushemereire kusiima Ruhanga obutoosha, ahabwanyu, B'eishe-emwe, nk'oku kishemereire, ahabw'okuba okwikiriza kwanyu nikweyongyera munonga, kandi n'okukunda kwa buri omwe omuriimwe oku murikukundana ni kwingi buzima. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:9">Kush 1:9</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo naitwe nitwehimbisa ahabwanyu omu makanisa ga Ruhanga, nitusiima okugumisiriza kwanyu n'okwikiriza kwanyu omu kuhiigwa n'omu kubonabona ebi mwemeire; <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:12">1 Tes 2:12</ref>. </char></note> (ebyo nibyoreka ku Ruhanga acwa emanja z'oburyo,) ngu mubone kuteekateekwa kuba abashemereire obukama bwa Ruhanga, obu murikubonabonera; <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 18:6">Kush 18:6</ref>, <ref loc="REV 18:7">7</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba Ruhanga naateekateeka ngu kihikire okwihura obusaasi abarikubasaasa, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Mat 25:31</ref>. </char></note> n'okuha imwe abarikushaasha okuhuumura naitwe, Mukama waitu Yesu ku arishuuruurwa naaruga omu iguru na baamaraika be ab'amaani, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:8">Rom 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:15">Isa 66:15</ref>. </char></note> ari omu muriro ogurikwaka, okuhoora enzigu abatarikumanya Ruhanga n'abarikwanga kworobera engiri ya Mukama waitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa 2:10</ref>. </char></note> Abo baryaheebwa ekifubiro eky'okuhwerekyerera okw'ebiro n'ebiro, babingwe omu maisho ga Mukama n'omu kitiinisa ky'obushoboorozi bwe, <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:4">Kol 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:7">Zab 89:7</ref>. </char></note> ku ariija aha izooba eryo kuhimbisibwa omu barikwera be, n'okutangaarirwa ahabw'abaamwikiriize boona, ahakuba obujurizi bwaitu obu twabahaire bukaikirizibwa. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Nikyo tubashabirira obutoosha, ngu Ruhanga waitu abaikirize okuba abashemereire okweta kwe, kandi ahikiirize n'amaani ge ebirungi byona ebi murikwetenga n'emirimo y'okwikiriza, <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:5">Isa 66:5</ref>. </char></note> eiziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu ribone kuhimbisibwa omuriimwe, naimwe omuriwe, nk'embabazi za Ruhanga waitu na Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo oku ziri.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Orugamba rw'Omuzigu wa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Ebirikukwata aha by'okwija kwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo n'okuteerana kwaitu okumubugana, nitubeeshengyereza, B'eishe-emwe, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />mutarahuka kuhahaaza emitima mukabura obwengye, mutajagarazibwa yaaba mwoyo nari ekigambo nari ebaruha, ei barikugira ngu ekahandiikwa itwe, ebirikuranga ngu ekiro kya Mukama kiiriire haihi. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:18">1 Yoh 2:18</ref>. </char></note> Hatagira omuntu owaababeihabeiha omu muringo gwona; ahakuba ekiro ekyo tikiriija, hatakabandize kubaho okutaana na Ruhanga, omuntu ogwo omugomi akashuuruurwa, niwe mwana w'okuhwerekyerera, <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ezk 28:2</ref>. </char></note> kandi omuzigu oyetunguura, akarwanisa ekintu kyona ekyetwa Ruhanga nari ekiramibwa, akashutama omuri hekalu ya Ruhanga, naayeyeta Ruhanga. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Timurikwijuka ku naabagambiire ebyo, nkiri owaanyu? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Kandi nimumanya ekirikumuzibira hati n'eki, ngu arekye kushuuruurwa obunaku bwe butakahikire. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Ahakuba enaama y'obugomi na mbwenu etandikire kukora; kwonka orikuzibira hati naija kugumizamu okuhitsya obu ariihwaho. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 19:15">Kush 19:15</ref>, <ref loc="REV 19:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Obwo, omugomi ogwo aryashuuruurwa, kandi Mukama waitu Yesu aryamwitsa orwoya rw'omu kanwa ke, amuhwerekyereze n'okumurinkana kw'ekitiinisa ky'okwija kwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Mat 24:24</ref>. </char></note> Omugomi ogwo oriija ahabw'amaani ga Sitaane, aryaija n'obushoboorozi bwona, n'obumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza by'ebishuba, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />n'obugobya bwona obubi obw'okuhabya ab'okuhwerekyerera, ahabw'okuba bakanga kukunda amazima ngu bajunwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:4">2 Tim 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Ruhanga arikubooherereza ekirikuhabya eky'amaani kubaikiririsa eby'ebishuba, <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />ngu boona abatarikiriize mazima, bakashemerererwa okutahikiirira, basingwe orubanja.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okugumya ab'eishe-emwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 1:4">Efe 1:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka kitushemereire kusiima Ruhanga obutoosha ahabwanyu, B'eishe-emwe abarikukundwa Mukama, ahakuba Ruhanga akabatooranira okujunwa iranaira ahabw'okwezibwa Omwoyo n'okwikiriza amazima. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Nikyo yaabeeteire n'engiri yaitu, ngu mutungye ekitiinisa kya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />N'ahabw'ekyo, B'eishe-emwe, mwemerere muhamire, mugumye emitwarize ei twabeegyeise, yaaba mu bigambo, nari omu baruha zaitu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Kandi Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo na Ruhanga Tataitwe, owaatukunzire akatuha okuhuumura okutahwaho n'amatsiko marungi ahabw'embabazi ze, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />ahuumuze emitima yaanyu, agigumye gye omu mirimo yoona emirungi n'ebigambo byona ebirungi.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 4:3">Kol 4:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eky'aha muheru, B'eishe-emwe, mutushabire, ekigambo kya Mukama kirahukye kubuga, nikiheebwa ekitiinisa, nk'oku kyabaire omuriimwe, <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />kandi naitwe tukire abantu babi abahabire; ahakuba abaine okwikiriza ti boona. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:24">1 Tes 5:24</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Mukama waitu n'ow'okwesigwa; aryabagumya, kandi abarinde Omubi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:10">Gal 5:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi hoona twine obwesigye omuri Mukama ahabwanyu, ngu nimukora ebi turikubaragiira, kandi nimwija kugumizamu nimubikora. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Mukama waitu atebeekanise emitima yaanyu omu kukunda kwa Ruhanga n'omu kugumisiriza kwa Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurwanisa obweremwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 18:17">Mat 18:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu nitubaragiira, B'eishe-emwe, omu iziina rya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, mwetantare ow'eishe-emwe weena omweremwa, otarikukuratira mitwarize ei mwatwegireho. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba naimwe ahabwanyu nimumanya oku mushemereire kutooreza emitwarize yaitu; obu twabaire turi owaanyu, tituragyendeire mu bweremwa, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:12">1 Kor 4:12</ref>. </char></note> titurariiriire busha by'okurya by'omuntu weena, kureka tukaba tukora munonga twecurenga nyomushana na nyekiro, ngu tutagira ou twarusya omuriimwe; <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />ti habw'okugira ngu tukaba tutashemereire kubikorerwa, kwonka tukenda ngu tube eky'okureeberaho, mubone kutooreza emitwarize yaitu. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:11">1 Tes 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Nangwa n'obu twabaire tukiri owaanyu, tukabaragiira tuti: Omuntu weena ku araabe atarikwenda kukora, arekye n'okurya. <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Ahakuba tuhuriire ngu omuriimwe harimu abeeremwa abatarikukora na kakye, kureka okwetaasya omu by'abandi. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Abantu nk'abo nitubaragiira, kandi nitubeehanangiriza omuri Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo kukora emirimo yaabo batuurize, babone kugira eby'okubatunga. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:9">Gal 6:9</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka imwe, B'eishe-emwe, murekye kuruha omu kukora gye.<verse eid="2TH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Omuntu weena otarikuhurira eki turikugamba omu baruha egi, mumumanye, mutakwatanisa nawe, abone kukwatwa enshoni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Kwonka mutamuteekateekaho nk'omuzigu, kureka mumuhabure nk'ow'eishe-emwe.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Kandi Mukama w'obusingye we wenka agume abahe obusingye ebiro byona n'omu miringo yoona. Mukama agume naimwe mwena. <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Nyowe Paulo, naahandiika endamutsyo egi n'omukono gwangye nyenka. Niko kamanyiso omu baruha yangye yoona; okwo nikwo mpandiika. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Embabazi za Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo zigume naimwe mwena.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>